    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 0.2
  m_Text: 'You are a world renowned spy known all over the animal kingdom (a raccoon
    who lives in Central Park who steals a lot of trash). One day, you get a notice
    that the metropolitan museum of art has a new exhibition; Cleopatra''s Treasure.
    Using your incredible skills, (opposable thumbs), and your unrelenting bravery,
    (stupidity), you must pull off the greatest heist of all to claim the greatest
    treasure of all time.


    In this heist puzzle game, you must make your way
    into, through, and out of the metropolitan museum of art by solving perplexing
    puzzles, using clever camouflage, and eccentric escapes.

'
